  "Software Details": "Softwaredetails",
  "The Marketing Module in eCommerceGo SaaS is designed to revolutionize the way you promote your business. With its robust features, you can easily activate, generate, and modify business cards to suit your brand's needs. Whether you're a new business owner or looking to refresh your brand's image, this module provides you with the flexibility to design business cards that truly represent your company's identity.": "De Marketing Module in eCommerceGo SaaS is ontworpen om een ​​revolutie teweeg te brengen in de manier waarop u uw bedrijf promoot. ",
  "View Live Demo": "Bekijk livedemo",
  "Enhance Your Business Reach with the Marketing Module": "Vergroot uw zakelijke bereik met de marketingmodule",
  "Boost your sales with our powerful marketing module, designed to streamline campaigns, track performance, and drive growth effortlessly": "Geef uw omzet een boost met onze krachtige marketingmodule, ontworpen om campagnes te stroomlijnen, prestaties bij te houden en moeiteloos groei te stimuleren",
  "Create and Edit Your Business Profile with Ease": "Creëer en bewerk eenvoudig uw bedrijfsprofiel",
  "Starting a new business or managing multiple brands? The Marketing Module offers seamless options for creating new business profiles and editing them as your needs evolve. This flexibility ensures that your business information is always up to date, keeping your brand relevant in a competitive market. The module’s user-friendly interface makes it simple to add or update contact details, logos, and promotional messages, ensuring your brand always looks professional.": "Een nieuw bedrijf starten of meerdere merken beheren? ",
  "Choose from a Variety of Business Themes": "Kies uit een verscheidenheid aan zakelijke thema's",
  "The Marketing Module also offers a range of customizable business themes to enhance your brand’s presentation. Whether you’re looking for something sleek and modern or classic and traditional, you can select from various themes that best align with your brand’s personality. Each theme is designed to maximize visual appeal and ensure consistency across all your marketing materials, helping you create a cohesive brand experience for your audience.": "De Marketing Module biedt ook een reeks aanpasbare zakelijke thema's om de presentatie van uw merk te verbeteren. ",
  "Drive Growth with Customizable Marketing Campaigns": "Stimuleer groei met aanpasbare marketingcampagnes",
  "Take your business to the next level by launching dynamic marketing campaigns directly from the platform. The Marketing Module allows you to create and run targeted campaigns that can reach your desired audience effectively. Use the platforms intuitive tools to customize your campaign strategies, set your budget, and track performance in real-time. This ensures your marketing efforts are both impactful and measurable, allowing for continuous improvement.": "Breng uw bedrijf naar een hoger niveau door dynamische marketingcampagnes rechtstreeks vanaf het platform te lanceren. ",
  "Streamline Your Marketing Efforts with All-in-One Tools": "Stroomlijn uw marketinginspanningen met alles-in-één tools",
  "With the Marketing Module, managing your business’s marketing efforts has never been easier. The module combines all necessary tools into one cohesive platform, allowing you to handle everything from business card creation to campaign management without ever leaving the platform. This integration simplifies your workflow, saves time, and reduces the complexity of managing multiple marketing tools, making it an essential solution for any business looking to grow.": "Met de Marketing Module is het beheren van de marketinginspanningen van uw bedrijf nog nooit zo eenvoudig geweest. ",
  "Why choose dedicated modules": "Waarom kiezen voor speciale modules",
  "for your business?": "voor uw bedrijf?",
  "With EcommerceGo, you can conveniently manage all your business functions from a single location": "Met EcommerceGo kunt u al uw zakelijke functies gemakkelijk vanaf één locatie beheren",
  "Empower Your Workforce with EcommerceGo": "Geef uw personeel meer mogelijkheden met EcommerceGo",
  "Access over Premium Add-ons for Product Enquiry, Product Review, Product Quick-view, and more, all in one place!": "Toegang tot Premium Add-ons voor productvragen, productbeoordelingen, snelle productweergave en meer, allemaal op één plek!",
